      "name": "Ingestion subprocess — derive content from the assets",
      "summary": "Derive content from an ingested source's assets: the archive, technical metadata, figures and tables, images, audio, tabular data, footnotes and provenance.",
      "description": "Derive content from an ingested source's assets: the archive, technical metadata, figures and tables, images, audio, tabular data, footnotes and provenance. Every step is an arm of `bun run cat ingest` (cat-harness-tools scripts/ingest-document.ts), so a re-ingest re-derives all of them; none is a step somebody runs by hand afterwards.",
